{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a Shopify Liquid section called “More Categories – Series Explorer”.
    
    IMPORTANT: Use **Shopify Section + Blocks**.
    
    ### SECTION = MORE CATEGORIES
    
    The section contains:
    
    **MORE CATEGORIES**
    
    A large horizontal-scroll gallery of Series cards.
    
    Each Series card is a **Shopify block**.
    
    Each block contains:
    
    * Series name
    * Large image
    * Description
    * Accent color
    * Border radius
    
    Example default blocks:
    Urban Carry, Craft Heritage, Travel Movement, Professional, Essential, Make It Personal, Craft Innovation.
    
    I must be able to **add, delete and reorder Series blocks** from the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    ### CLICK SERIES BLOCK
    
    When a Series block is clicked:
    
    Do NOT redirect to another page.
    
    Do NOT open a modal or popup.
    
    Instead, **expand the selected block's product content downward on the same page**.
    
    Only one Series can be expanded at a time.
    
    Example:
    
    [ Urban Carry ] [ Craft Heritage ] [ Travel Movement ]
    
    Click Urban Carry ↓
    
    **URBAN CARRY**
    
    [ Product Category ]
    
    BAG — View all
    
    [Product 1] [Product 2] [Product 3] [Product 4]
    
    [ Product Category ]
    
    BACKPACK — View all
    
    [Product 1] [Product 2] [Product 3] [Product 4]
    
    ### PRODUCT CATEGORIES
    
    Do NOT hardcode Bag / Backpack / Belt / Wallet.
    
    Inside each Series block, allow **dynamic Product Category blocks**.
    
    Each Product Category block must have:
    
    * Category name
    * Shopify Collection selector
    * Number of products
    
    I must be able to **add, delete and reorder Product Category blocks** for every Series.
    
    Example:
    
    Series Block
    → Category Block
    → Category Block
    → Category Block
    → Category Block
    
    ### PRODUCTS
    
    Products must come dynamically from the selected Shopify Collection using Liquid.
    
    Do not hardcode product names, images or prices.
    
    Desktop: 4 products per row.
    Mobile: 2 products per row.
    
    ### INTERACTION
    
    Use Vanilla JavaScript.
    
    Click Series → expand its products below.
    
    Click another Series → collapse previous Series and expand the new Series.
    
    Click active Series → collapse it.
    
    Use smooth expand/collapse animation.
    
    No page refresh, no URL change, no popup, no modal.
    
    ### DESIGN
    
    Premium modern heritage style:
    
    Warm cream, beige, dark brown, muted green, warm orange, minimal editorial layout, large photography and rounded corners.
    
    The final structure must be:
    
    **SECTION**
    → horizontal Series Blocks
    
    **SERIES BLOCK**
    → Series information
    → Product Category Blocks
    → Shopify Collection Products
    
    Everything must be editable through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    , Fix the existing **More Categories – Series Explorer** section.
    
    The Series cards already work correctly. **Do not redesign the Series cards.**
    
    The problem is:
    
    When I click a Series, it only shows the Series name, but the product content is empty.
    
    ### FIX THIS:
    
    When a Series block is expanded, it MUST render the product categories and products configured inside that Series block.
    
    For example:
    
    URBAN CARRY
    
    BAG — View all
    
    [ Product 1 ] [ Product 2 ] [ Product 3 ] [ Product 4 ]
    
    BACKPACK — View all
    
    [ Product 1 ] [ Product 2 ] [ Product 3 ] [ Product 4 ]
    
    ### IMPORTANT
    
    Do NOT hardcode BAG, BACKPACK, BELT or WALLET.
    
    Each Series must have editable **Product Category blocks**.
    
    Each Product Category block must contain:
    
    * Category name
    * Shopify Collection selector
    * Number of products to display
    
    When the Series expands, use Shopify Liquid to loop through the selected collection:
    
    `category_collection.products`
    
    and render:
    
    * Product image
    * Product title
    * Product price
    * Compare-at price if available
    * Product URL
    
    ### IMPORTANT SHOPIFY STRUCTURE
    
    Make sure the Liquid actually renders the nested category blocks inside the selected Series.
    
    The structure should work like:
    
    Section
    → Series block
    → Product Category block
    → Selected Collection
    → Collection products
    
    Do NOT only render the Series title.
    
    If Shopify section blocks cannot be nested directly, use a compatible block/data structure so that each Series still has its own multiple Product Category settings and collections.
    
    ### EMPTY COLLECTION HANDLING
    
    If no collection has been selected for a category, show:
    
    **Select a collection in Theme Editor**
    
    instead of leaving an empty area.
    
    If a collection is selected, its products MUST appear.
    
    ### FINAL BEHAVIOUR
    
    Click:
    
    **URBAN CARRY**
    
    ↓
    
    Expand:
    
    URBAN CARRY
    
    BAG — View all
    
    [Product 1] [Product 2] [Product 3] [Product 4]
    
    BACKPACK — View all
    
    [Product 1] [Product 2] [Product 3] [Product 4]
    
    Click:
    
    **CRAFT HERITAGE**
    
    ↓
    
    Urban Carry collapses.
    
    Craft Heritage expands with its OWN categories and products.
    
    Do not change the existing horizontal Series image scroll design. Only fix the expanded Series content so the selected Shopify Collections and their products are actually rendered.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}{% style %}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;background:#F4EFDC;color:#2B2420;padding:40px 0}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rail{display:flex;gap:16px;overflow-x:auto;padding:0 20px}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex:0 0 280px;border:0;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:#F9F4E3;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8DA68A}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card img,.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card svg{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy{padding:18px;border-top:5px solid var(--accent)}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy h3{margin:0 0 6px}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy p{margin:0;color:#7A7263}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;transition:max-height .4s ease,opacity .25s ease}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel.is-open{opacity:1}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel-inner{padding:30px 20px}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__category{margin:0 0 30px}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__category-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #C9C2AC;margin-bottom:15px}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__category-head h3{margin:0 0 10px}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__category-head a{color:#2B2420}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product{color:#2B2420;text-decoration:none}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product img,.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product svg{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:10px}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-title,.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-price{display:block;margin-top:8px}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-price{color:#7A7263}.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty{color:#7A7263}@media(max-width:749px){.ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__products{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}{% endstyle %}<series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><h2>{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2><div class="ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rail">{% for i in (1..3) %}{% assign nk='series_'|append:i|append:'_name' %}{% assign ik='series_'|append:i|append:'_image' %}{% assign dk='series_'|append:i|append:'_description' %}{% assign ak='series_'|append:i|append:'_accent' %}<button class="ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card" data-id="{{ i }}" type="button" style="--accent:{{ block.settings[ak] }}">{% if block.settings[ik] %}<img src="{{ block.settings[ik] | image_url: width:700 }}" alt="{{ block.settings[nk] | escape }}">{% else %}{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}{% endif %}<div class="ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy"><h3>{{ block.settings[nk] }}</h3><p>{{ block.settings[dk] }}</p></div></button>{% endfor %}</div>{% for i in (1..3) %}{% assign nk='series_'|append:i|append:'_name' %}<div class="ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel" data-panel="{{ i }}"><div class="ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel-inner"><h2>{{ block.settings[nk] }}</h2>{% for c in (1..4) %}{% assign name_key='series_'|append:i|append:'_category_'|append:c|append:'_name' %}{% assign collection_key='series_'|append:i|append:'_category_'|append:c|append:'_collection' %}{% assign count_key='series_'|append:i|append:'_category_'|append:c|append:'_count' %}{% assign category_collection=block.settings[collection_key] %}{% if block.settings[name_key] != blank %}<section class="ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__category"><div class="ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__category-head"><h3>{{ block.settings[name_key] }}</h3>{% if category_collection %}<a href="{{ category_collection.url }}">View all</a>{% endif %}</div>{% if category_collection %}<div class="ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__products">{% for product in category_collection.products limit: block.settings[count_key] %}<a class="ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product" href="{{ product.url }}">{% if product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width:500 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}">{% else %}{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}{% endif %}<span class="ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-title">{{ product.title }}</span><span class="ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-price">{{ product.price | money }}{% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %} <s>{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</s>{% endif %}</span></a>{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<p class="ai-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty">Select a collection in Theme Editor</p>{% endif %}</section>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></div>{% endfor %}</series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}><script>(function(){class X extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.querySelectorAll('[data-id]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{this.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]').forEach(p=>{let o=p.dataset.panel===b.dataset.id&&!p.classList.contains('is-open');p.classList.toggle('is-open',o);p.style.maxHeight=o?p.scrollHeight+'px':'0px'})}))}}customElements.define('series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}',X)})();</script>{% schema %}{"name":"Series explorer","tag":null,"class":"series-explorer","settings":[{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"More categories"},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"header","content":"Series 1"},{"type":"text","id":"series_1_name","label":"Name","default":"Urban Carry"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"series_1_image","label":"Image"},{"type":"textarea","id":"series_1_description","label":"Description","default":"Designed for everyday movement."},{"type":"color","id":"series_1_accent","label":"Accent","default":"#C4823A"},{"type":"header","content":"Series 2"},{"type":"text","id":"series_2_name","label":"Name","default":"Craft Heritage"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"series_2_image","label":"Image"},{"type":"textarea","id":"series_2_description","label":"Description","default":"Timeless materials and considered details."},{"type":"color","id":"series_2_accent","label":"Accent","default":"#8DA68A"},{"type":"header","content":"Series 3"},{"type":"text","id":"series_3_name","label":"Name","default":"Travel Movement"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"series_3_image","label":"Image"},{"type":"textarea","id":"series_3_description","label":"Description","default":"Made for the journey ahead."},{"type":"color","id":"series_3_accent","label":"Accent","default":"#C4823A"},{"type":"header","content":"Product categories"},{"type":"paragraph","content":"Add a category name and collection for each Series. Leave unused categories blank."},{"type":"text","id":"series_1_category_1_name","label":"Series 1 category 1","default":"Bag"},{"type":"collection","id":"series_1_category_1_collection","label":"Series 1 collection 1"},{"type":"range","id":"series_1_category_1_count","label":"Series 1 products 1","min":1,"max":12,"step":1,"default":4},{"type":"text","id":"series_1_category_2_name","label":"Series 1 category 2","default":"Backpack"},{"type":"collection","id":"series_1_category_2_collection","label":"Series 1 collection 2"},{"type":"range","id":"series_1_category_2_count","label":"Series 1 products 2","min":1,"max":12,"step":1,"default":4},{"type":"text","id":"series_2_category_1_name","label":"Series 2 category 1","default":"Category"},{"type":"collection","id":"series_2_category_1_collection","label":"Series 2 collection 1"},{"type":"range","id":"series_2_category_1_count","label":"Series 2 products 1","min":1,"max":12,"step":1,"default":4},{"type":"text","id":"series_3_category_1_name","label":"Series 3 category 1","default":"Category"},{"type":"collection","id":"series_3_category_1_collection","label":"Series 3 collection 1"},{"type":"range","id":"series_3_category_1_count","label":"Series 3 products 1","min":1,"max":12,"step":1,"default":4}],"presets":[{"name":"Series explorer"}]}{% endschema %}